{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","盾墙突击"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉降低即将受到的伤害，一段时间后用盾眩晕周围敌人，随后用矛击倒周围敌人并造成伤害，同时恢复自身生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉架起盾牌，嘲讽周围2格的敌人1秒，使自身受到的伤害降低60%并处于霸体状态，持续5秒。随后高举盾牌眩晕周围1格的敌人2秒，并挥舞长矛击倒周围1格的敌人并造成400% ATK伤害，同时恢复自身20% + 5% HP的生命值，每命中一名敌人额外恢复8% + 2% HP的生命值。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":102,"end":107,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":128,"end":133,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":11,"tooltip_key":"keyword:taunt"},{"start":37,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":82,"end":90,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":99,"end":110,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":126,"end":136,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至420% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至440% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至450% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至460% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":13,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","盾阵固守"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","选择友军作为“守护对象”。为自己和“守护对象”添加护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，安丹德拉选择除自己以外最靠前的友军作为“守护对象”。使用该技能时，安丹德拉为自己和“守护对象”添加能抵御相当于“守护对象”最大生命值15% + 5%伤害的护盾，持续5秒，护盾值最高不超过自身500%攻击力。若“守护对象”被击败，则会重新选择除自己以外最靠前的友方作为“守护对象”。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":75,"end":80,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“守护对象”每失去10%的生命值，减少该技能3秒剩余冷却时间。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至“守护对象”最大生命值的20% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾抵御值上升至“守护对象”最大生命值的25% + 5%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":28,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","矛刺连击"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","连续攻击前方3次，降低目标攻击力。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉连续攻击前方1格扇形区域3次并降低目标20%攻击力，持续6 + 1秒，前2次攻击造成100% ATK伤害，第3次攻击造成120%伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":37,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":46,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击伤害提升至140% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击伤害提升至160% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","第3次攻击伤害提升至180% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","疾风之护"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","冲向“守护对象”，使其受到的伤害降低。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“守护对象”的生命值比例首次低于50%时，安丹德拉会冲向“守护对象”身边，使“守护对象”受到的伤害降低40%，持续10秒。该技能在一场战斗内对每个“守护对象”至多使用一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉冲向“守护对象”身边后，还会使“守护对象”每秒恢复100点能量，持续4秒。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉冲向“守护对象”身边后，“守护对象”受到的伤害降低50%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","安丹德拉冲向“守护对象”身边后，“守护对象”受到的伤害降低60%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“盾墙突击”命中敌人时永久提升自己护甲。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“盾墙突击”每命中一名敌人永久提升自己10%的护甲，最多叠加6次。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","技能“盾阵固守”为“守护对象”添加的护盾值提升，提升量相当于安丹德拉40%的当前生命值。此外，“守护对象”在拥有该护盾期间造成伤害时会为安丹德拉回复生命值，回复量等同于伤害量的60%。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","破军之武"]]}